WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
You run to my house

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,400
Pointing a gun at my pregnant wife

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,380
Want to die now

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,930
How could anything be so cheap?

5
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:15,660
Does it hurt? Does it hurt?

6
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:18,300
My hands are so hot and I still talk so harshly.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,420
What do those people do?

8
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,420
This is not an ordinary death-scanning picture

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,550
Starting tonight

10
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:24,550
I'm not at home

11
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:26,550
You and Niuniu must never open the courtyard door.

12
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,550
Is something going to happen again in the back mountain?

13
00:00:27,550 --> 00:00:28,550
It's not a mountain accident

14
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:34,660
There are people who have a long life and remember it

15
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,040
People you don’t know dare to step through the door and look at it

16
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:41,030
I'll shoot right
